WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.134 --> 00:00:16.159
Kip fell off the snowball.

2
00:00:16.160 --> 00:00:19.201
He slid across the frozen pond.

3
00:00:19.202 --> 00:00:23.829
Finally he stopped.

4
00:00:23.830 --> 00:00:28.819
Kip sighed. "Bird was right.

5
00:00:28.820 --> 00:00:35.208
I can't play in the snow now.

6
00:00:35.209 --> 00:00:39.078
I'll go back home."

7
00:00:39.079 --> 00:00:41.230
He climbed to his feet.

8
00:00:41.231 --> 00:00:44.205
But then—whoosh!

9
00:00:44.206 --> 00:00:47.377
The ice was very slippery.

10
00:00:47.378 --> 00:00:53.252
Kip fell hard. Bam!

11
00:00:53.253 --> 00:00:55.855
"Ouch!" cried Kip.

12
00:00:55.856 --> 00:00:58.891
Kip got back on his feet.

13
00:00:58.892 --> 00:01:02.643
His feet slipped again! Bam!

14
00:01:02.644 --> 00:01:06.289
"Ouch!" Kip cried again.

15
00:01:06.290 --> 00:01:08.875
Carefully Kip stood up again.

16
00:01:08.876 --> 00:01:13.485
He walked slowly.

17
00:01:13.486 --> 00:01:18.308
He slipped and fell four more times.

18
00:01:18.309 --> 00:01:31.834
Finally Kip was off the frozen pond.

19
00:01:31.835 --> 00:01:40.127
He climbed back up his tree.

20
00:01:40.128 --> 00:01:43.722
He took off his snow gear.

21
00:01:43.723 --> 00:02:04.448
And he got back into bed.

22
00:02:04.449 --> 00:02:06.793
Later that day Bird woke him.

23
00:02:06.794 --> 00:02:10.285
"The blizzard is over, Kip!" said Bird.

24
00:02:10.286 --> 00:02:13.079
"Let's play in the snow!"

25
00:02:13.080 --> 00:02:20.019
Kip moaned. "Maybe tomorrow, Bird.

26
00:02:20.020 --> 00:02:27.156
I'm done playing in the snow today!"
